menta-install (1.0.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Debian Menta, forked from mintinstall 8.4.1.
  * Rename to menta-install: /usr/lib/menta-install, /usr/share/menta-install,
    org.debianmenta.install settings, org.debianmenta.MentaInstall app ID.
  * Bundle the installer backend from mint-common, and replace aptkit with
    built-in confirmation and progress dialogs on top of PackageKit.
  * Remove the dependencies on XApp and python3-xapp.
  * Get icons for Debian packages from the DEP-11 AppStream metadata instead
    of app-install-data, and screenshots from screenshots.debian.net.
  * Get ratings and reviews from the Open Desktop Ratings Service, and
    let users write reviews from the application.
  * Show a "Verified" badge on Flatpaks verified by Flathub, next to the
    existing "Unverified" one.
  * Replace the hamburger menu with a traditional menu bar.
  * Open menta-sources for the software sources.
  * Remove Linux Mint and HamoniKR specific packages, links and settings.
  * Add a package installer window for local .deb files (GDebi-like), also
    available from File > Open Package File.
  * Provide the PackageKit session D-Bus interface, so the file manager can
    search for applications able to open a file type.

 -- Kerem Söke <keremsoke@gmail.com>  Mon, 05 Oct 2026 17:48:17 -0700
